import scene_character_poses.dl

to [move website Farm character] {a pointer to website Farm character:character} [toward] {vector:position} [facing] {integer:direction} [over] {floating-point number:duration} [seconds instantly] {boolean:instant}:
    if instant:
        place UI scene motion (character's motion) at position facing (the website Farm heading for direction)
    else:
        aim UI scene motion (character's motion) at position facing (the website Farm heading for direction) over duration seconds
    set character's seen to true
    place website Farm character character with weight (character's motion's weight)

to [update website Farm person] {a pointer to website farm actor:actor} [wearing] {integer:outfit} [from] {a pointer to website farm world:world} [in] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters} [over] {floating-point number:duration} [seconds instantly] {boolean:instant}:
    set position to the website Farm scene point at (actor's x) (actor's y) in world
    set entry to the website Farm character named (actor's id) in characters
    if entry = (0 as a pointer to website Farm character):
        set entry to a website Farm character named (actor's id) of kind 0 using (the item at outfit in (characters's people)) at position facing (actor's direction) in characters
    set entry's chopping to actor's status starts with "Chopping"
    equip website Farm character entry from actor in characters
    move website Farm character entry toward position facing (actor's direction) over duration seconds instantly instant

to [update website Farm animal] {website farm animal:animal} [of kind] {integer:kind} [using] {UI scene model:model} [from] {a pointer to website farm world:world} [in] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters} [over] {floating-point number:duration} [seconds instantly] {boolean:instant}:
    set position to the website Farm scene point at (animal's x) (animal's y) in world
    set entry to the website Farm character named (animal's id) in characters
    if entry = (0 as a pointer to website Farm character):
        set entry to a website Farm character named (animal's id) of kind kind using model at position facing (animal's direction) in characters
    move website Farm character entry toward position facing (animal's direction) over (duration * 1.8) seconds instantly instant

to [update website Farm characters] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters} [from] {a pointer to website farm world:world} [over] {floating-point number:duration} [seconds instantly] {boolean:instant}:
    for each entry in characters's entries:
        set entry's seen to false
    update website Farm person (world's player) wearing 0 from world in characters over duration seconds instantly instant
    set index to 0
    for each worker in world's workers:
        update website Farm person worker wearing ((index % 6) + 1) from world in characters over duration seconds instantly instant
        increment index
    if world's cow present:
        update website Farm animal (world's cow) of kind 1 using (characters's cow) from world in characters over duration seconds instantly instant
    set index to 1
    for each chicken in world's chickens:
        update website Farm animal chicken of kind 2 using (characters's chicken) from world in characters over duration seconds instantly instant
        set entry to the website Farm character named (chicken's id) in characters
        set entry's phase offset to index * 2.0
        increment index
    set index to (the length of characters's entries) - 1
    loop while index >= 0:
        set entry to the item at index in (characters's entries)
        if entry's seen = false:
            close website Farm character entry in characters
            remove item index from characters's entries
        decrement index

to get [website Farm characters for] {a pointer to website farm world:world} [in] {a pointer to website Farm landscape:landscape}:
    set result to storage for one slot initialized with (a new website Farm characters)
    set result's landscape to landscape
    set result's entries to an empty list of a pointer to website Farm character
    set library to the address of (landscape's library)
    set colors to [15655869,13470537,6197913,11631760,9147488,11834194,7834542]
    loop index from 0 to 7:
        store (a Farm farmer wearing (UI ink from RGB (the item at index in colors)) with library) into result's people at index
    set result's cow to a Farm cow with library
    set result's chicken to a Farm chicken turned 0.0 with library
    update website Farm characters result from world over 0.5 seconds instantly true
    return result

to get [advance website Farm characters] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters} [at] {floating-point number:time} [over] {floating-point number:seconds} [seconds dragging] {a value:dragged}:
    set moving to false
    for each entry in characters's entries:
        set changed to pose website Farm character entry at time over seconds seconds dragging (entry's id = dragged)
        set moving to changed or moving
    return moving

to [close website Farm characters] {a pointer to website Farm characters:characters}:
    for each entry in characters's entries:
        close website Farm character entry in characters
    free characters's entries
    destroy the value at characters
    deallocate characters
